[
  {
    "id": 0,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ここが錬金術部の部室かあ……\nフロッケ、こっそりこっそりね",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "So this is the Alchemy Club room... Flocke, quiet now... real quiet..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ハイディ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Heidi"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 1,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "は、はいっ。そろーり……そろーり……",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Y-yes! *shuffle shuffle*"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "フロッケ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Flocke"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 2,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "あら、珍しいお客さんね",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "My, what unusual visitors we have."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ザスキア",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Saskia"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 3,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ひゃいっ！？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Eep!?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "フロッケ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Flocke"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 4,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "も、もう見つかった……\nあはは、どうもー……",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Aw man, already busted...? Hehe, how's it going..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ハイディ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Heidi"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 5,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "あなたたち、シャッフェン科学学校の……\nうちの部になんのご用事かしら？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "You two are from Schaffen Science Academy, aren't you? What business do you have with our club?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ザスキア",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Saskia"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 6,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "錬金術部が何やら文化祭で面白そうな出し物をする\nって言うんで、ちょっと気になって見に来たんですよ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "We heard the Alchemy Club is planning something interesting for the cultural festival, so we got curious and came to take a peek."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ハイディ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Heidi"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 7,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "なるほど。敵情視察ってわけね。\nいい趣味してるじゃない",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "I see. A little reconnaissance mission, is it? You guys are something else."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ミミ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Mimi"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 8,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "む……いいでしょ別に",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Hmph... there's nothing wrong with that."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ハイディ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Heidi"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 9,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "まあ、隠すようなことでもないでしょう。\nどうぞ見学して行って",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Well, it's not as if we have anything to hide. Feel free to look around."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ザスキア",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Saskia"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 10,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "……ま、先生もああ言ってるし、見ていけば？\n作業の邪魔はしないでよ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "...Since Miss Saskia says it's fine, go ahead and look. Just don't mess with our work."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ミミ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Mimi"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 11,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ソフィー先輩。レシピの案をいくつか考えて\nみたんですけど……",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Miss Sophie, I've come up with some recipe ideas..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "レスナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 12,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "うーん。どれも難易度高いかも。\n安全第一だから、もう少し簡単なやつ考えてみて",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Hmm. These all look pretty difficult. We need to prioritize safety, so let's think of something a bit simpler."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ソフィー",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Sophie"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 13,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "なるほど……分かりました！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Alright, I understand!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "レスナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 14,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "このクラフト使って野球しようぜー！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Let's play baseball with this craft!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "部員Ａ（鎧騎士）",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Club Member A (Armored Knight)"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 15,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "じゃあ俺審判な",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Then I'll be the umpire!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "部員Ｂ（鎧騎士）",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Club Member B (Armored Knight)"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 16,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ちょっと騎士～！\nサボってないで真面目にやって～！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Hey, knights! Stop slacking off and get back to work!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ライザ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Ryza"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 17,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "皆さん、忙しそうですね……",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Everyone seems so busy..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "フロッケ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Flocke"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 18,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "で、錬金術部の出し物ってなんなの？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "So what exactly is the Alchemy Club's exhibit?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ハイディ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Heidi"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 19,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ずばり、「錬金術体験教室」よ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Simply put, an Alchemy Experience Workshop."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ミミ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Mimi"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 20,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "錬金術体験……？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Alchemy experience...?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ハイディ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Heidi"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 21,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "錬金術を使うには特殊な才能が必要だけれど、素材の\n下準備をしたり釜をかき混ぜる手伝いなら誰でもできる",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "While special talent is needed to use alchemy properly, anyone can help prepare materials or stir the cauldron."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ミミ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Mimi"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 22,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "お客様にはそれを体験してもらって、\n錬金術の疑似体験をしてもらうというわけ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Visitors will get to experience that and get a taste of what alchemy is like."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ミミ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Mimi"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 23,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ふーん。それ、面白いのかなあ……？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Hmm. Is that really going to be interesting...?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ハイディ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Heidi"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 24,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "なら、実際に体験してみる？\nちょうどサンプルのレシピが１つできたところなの",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Why don't you try it yourself? We just finished a sample recipe."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ミミ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Mimi"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 25,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "で、できた……！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "We... we actually made it...!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ハイディ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Heidi"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 26,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "これをフロッケたちが……！？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Is this really our handiwork!?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "フロッケ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Flocke"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 27,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ふふ、どう？\u3000なかなか楽しいものでしょ？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Well? Pretty fun, isn't it?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ミミ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Mimi"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 28,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "はい！\u3000とっても楽しかったです！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Yes! It was so much fun!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "フロッケ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Flocke"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 29,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "く……悔しいけど、認めざるを得ない……",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Ugh... as much as I hate to admit it..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ハイディ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Heidi"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 30,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "本番までに、他にも色んなレシピを用意する\n予定だから。あなたたちにこれが超えられるかしら？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "By the time of the festival, we'll have many different recipes prepared. Think you can top this?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ミミ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Mimi"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 31,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "くっそー！\u3000覚えとけー！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Ugh! Just you wait!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ハイディ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Heidi"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 32,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ま、待ってくださーい！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "W-wait for meee!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "フロッケ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Flocke"
        }
      }
    }
  }
]